# Agent scratch: plan docs land in docs/superpowers/ above, and the ledgers,
# briefs and review packages of a plan being executed land here. Both are
# working artifacts of writing the diff, never part of it -- and an ignore
# that covers only one of them leaves the other one `git add -A` away from
# inflating a PR's diff stat, which is the signal reviewers size scope by.
.superpowers/

# knightwatch materializes declared review siblings here during a review.
.siblings/
